<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3364" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκέομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cure, remedy</i>, c. gen. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					22.481
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυμφικῶν ἑδωλίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					71
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύβους . . τερπνὸν ἀργίας ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					479.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακὸν κακῷ διδοὺς ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					363
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. εὑρεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.250
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίζησθαι, ἐξευρεῖν, ἐκπονεῖν,
				λαβεῖν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.187
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				367
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				327
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκη ποιεῖσθαι</span>, c. dat.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				910a
			</span></i>: in medical sense, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; by a medical metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ.
				ἐντέμνειν, τέμνειν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				121
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. τομαῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					539
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. [ἔστι</span>], c.
			inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. γὰρ οὐδὲν τόνδε
				θρηνεῖσθαι</span>
			<i>it boots</i> not to . . , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>means of obtaining</i> a thing, c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωτηρίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1055
				</span></i>
			.</div>
